! M.frr — Stub AS, customer of D
!
! M has a single upstream connection to provider D (10.1.8.2).
!
! As a stub, M:
!   - Announces only its own prefix (10.255.13.1/32) to D via the 'network' statement.
!   - Accepts all routes from D for global reachability.
!   - Provides no transit to any other AS.
!
! Money logic: M pays D for transit. No other commercial relationships exist.

route-map FROM-PROVIDER permit 10
 set local-preference 100
!
router bgp __ASN__
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  neighbor 10.1.8.2 route-map FROM-PROVIDER in
 exit-address-family
!
